  "summary_text": "Acmeway\nAcmeway agreed to the pilot at $20/seat\nInvoicing setup and support tickets and next steps\nInvoicing setup is fine for now\nInvoicing setup is a little fragile\nInvoicing setup is way more complicated than it looks\nSupport tickets and usage reports seen as one underlying problem\nFeedback on next steps from someone on sales: they pushed back a bit\nPreference to simplify it rather than test it with a few users\nRenewal conversation and escalation path and email digests\nRenewal conversation and doc seen as one underlying problem\nNo clear owner for escalation path\nConcern with email digests: that we end up rebuilding it\nNo clear owner for email digests\nPreference to look at it with fresh eyes rather than sanity check the assumptions\nNext steps\nPriya to send Acmeway the order form by Friday",
  "summary_markdown": "### Acmeway\n- Acmeway agreed to the pilot at $20/seat\n\n### Invoicing setup and support tickets and next steps\n- Invoicing setup is fine for now\n  - Invoicing setup is a little fragile\n  - Invoicing setup is way more complicated than it looks\n- Support tickets and usage reports seen as one underlying problem\n- Feedback on next steps from someone on sales: they pushed back a bit\n- Preference to simplify it rather than test it with a few users\n\n### Renewal conversation and escalation path and email digests\n- Renewal conversation and doc seen as one underlying problem\n- No clear owner for escalation path\n- Concern with email digests: that we end up rebuilding it\n  - No clear owner for email digests\n- Preference to look at it with fresh eyes rather than sanity check the assumptions\n\n### Next steps\n- Priya to send Acmeway the order form by **Friday**",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
