      },
      "text": "Like, like the metrics took like like five people last time, if that makes sense. But we keep going back and forth on the feedback. Anyway, what would it take to get more data? Okay, so the requirements came up yesterday too, at least for now. Actually, for Acmeway specifically, the invoicing setup is fine fine for now.",
