      "end_time": "2026-09-10T16:05:33.235000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dana Ortiz"
      },
      "text": "To be fair, honestly the spreadsheet only needs most of the afternoon if we document the decision. Okay yeah, it's funny, the scope looked better than last week on Friday and now the feedback was mixed. Funny enough, I spent half a day on the mobile adoption and it's been quiet. Like, it feels like the renewal conversation and the doc are kind of the same problem. Anyway, I'm kind of torn about the communication plan. Yeah, so I keep coming back to the risks and stuff. So So nobody really owns the escalation path right now, I think. But how did like the help center articles go?",
