      "end_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:09.952000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay",
      "start_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:13.034000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:13.634000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I'd rather simplify it than test it with a few users, but yeah. I think we lost 12 steps on the feedback after standup, in my opinion...",
      "start_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:13.660000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:22.660000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Funny Funny enough",
      "start_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:24.196000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:25.196000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "my worry with the email digests is that we end up rebuilding it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:25.286000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:29.619000Z"
