      "end_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:29.145000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dana Ortiz"
      },
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:30.655000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-10T16:06:31.255000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, so it's less about the like roadmap call and more about the bulk import, kind of. Which, on Acmeway, it seems to come and go and stuff. I feel like if the kickoff deck slips again, Acmeway going to feel it. Yeah, so Acmeway is kind of the test case for the spreadsheet. Also, I'd rather look at it with fresh eyes than sanity check the assumptions, I think. So yeah, nobody really owns owns the mobile adoption right now, anyway. So I'd love to clean up the backlog, but the feedback from their managers is in good shape. That's basically what we saw with the legal review on Acmeway",
