      "end_time": "2026-09-10T16:07:55.548000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dana Ortiz"
      },
      "text": "And I talked to someone on sales about the success plan and they were pretty chill about it.",
