      "end_time": "2026-09-10T16:08:48.146000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I'd rather draw it on a whiteboard than pair on it, anyway. So are we worried about the audit trail?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-10T16:08:48.231000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-10T16:08:54.897000Z"
