      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Well, nobody really owns the email digests right now, at uh, least for now. Anyway, the data residency question is bigger than we scoped, which is fine. Mm, I keep coming back to the Slack thread, so yeah. Okay, so should we just cut the scope? I feel like it's like, the invoicing setup is way more complicated than it looks and nobody wants to say it.",
